  "content": {
    "id": "p43-q5-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "For $f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2}{576}$ on $0\\le x\\le12$, find to 2 d.p.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p43-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "the 20th percentile",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$7.02$",
          "worked": "For $0\\le x\\le12$,\n$$\\begin{align*}F(x)&=\\int_0^x\\frac{t^2}{576}\\,dt\\\\&=\\left[\\frac{t^3}{1728}\\right]_0^x\\\\&=\\frac{x^3}{1728}.\\end{align*}$$\nLet $p$ be the 20th percentile.\n$$\\begin{align*}F(p)&=0.20\\\\\\frac{p^3}{1728}&=0.20\\\\p^3&=345.6\\\\p&=\\sqrt[3]{345.6}\\\\p&\\approx7.02.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 43
      },
      {
        "id": "p43-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "the median",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$9.52$",
          "worked": "Using $F(x)=\\dfrac{x^3}{1728}$ on $[0,12]$, let $m$ be the median.\n$$\\begin{align*}F(m)&=0.5\\\\\\frac{m^3}{1728}&=\\frac12\\\\m^3&=864\\\\m&=\\sqrt[3]{864}\\\\m&\\approx9.52.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p43-q5-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "the 3rd quartile",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$10.90$",
          "worked": "Using $F(x)=\\dfrac{x^3}{1728}$ on $[0,12]$,\n$$\\begin{align*}F(Q_3)&=0.75\\\\\\frac{Q_3^3}{1728}&=\\frac34\\\\Q_3^3&=1296\\\\Q_3&=\\sqrt[3]{1296}\\\\Q_3&\\approx10.90.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      }
    ]
